# Map injections rawdata

# Description: This script creates a map_injection csv file for every rawdata file.
# It adjusts LICORTIME to REALTIME using an offset and includes all planned injections.

# Rules for labels (remarks during acquisition):
# 1. Each label identifies an injection sequence (same sample, same volume)
# 2. Each label must be unique for a given day of analysis
# 3. The underscore symbol ("_") is reserved to separate sample identity from volume in ml
# 4. The injection volume must be present at the end of the label, in mL
# 5. Corrections should be made manually in the corrected_...csv files

